(text "ESP32-S3 (Freenove Lite, FNK0099), soldered: USB toward the box's left wall" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c3ddf747-1f38-54f3-a700-a3cb4d171e57"))
(text "TMC2209 stepper driver (StepStick module), soldered" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 157.48 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e3610a51-fc74-5ef0-a0fa-72312f2f44e6"))
(text "12 V input: D1 against reverse polarity; a jumper on JP1 bypasses it" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 271.78 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8f29b808-ee6d-5ded-9d35-61667d8387c6"))
(text "Connectors (2.54 mm male headers)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 284.48 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cfc774cc-fd99-5b34-8c2a-35aeb8b5fea0"))
(text "Fan, temperature-probe and driver resistors; 12 V sense divider" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "37d874f9-fce6-56f4-a389-912cc34e5a98"))
(text "Test pads" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 157.48 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0cea2ae8-a324-5f08-ac18-094de7a9575b"))
(text "Mounting holes (M2)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 233.68 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a4bbe4a-8162-5533-9f21-58f4e5f77de7"))
(text "Nets with the same label are connected. Pins as in firmware/baremetal/Pins.h." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "656a5703-a8fe-5acb-a7ae-eab8753be23b"))
(text "U1 pins 1-20 are its left header (3V3 ... 5V) and 21-40 its right header (TX ... GND), top to bottom as on the board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 237.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fb98fbab-e772-58d4-9c52-d1f03f13282b"))
(text "U2: MS1 = MS2 = GND (UART address 0); CLK and PDN free. DIAG is not on this module's pins: GPIO 13 goes to TP5." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee986c74-7627-5ee8-a98e-127f32d5ba77"))
(text "R6 1k: single-wire UART, TX through 1k and RX straight onto PDN_UART. R5 holds the driver off (EN high) while the ESP32 boots." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 245.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0186a28f-7b12-5bf6-97cf-3c34cdf9c93b"))
(text "R7/R8: 12 V reads 2.16 V on GPIO 1 (ADC1). R2/R4 keep the fans slow at boot; R1/R3 tach pull-ups; R9/R10 1-Wire pull-ups." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1c95d58-8dac-590f-9fda-8605692a3dbb"))
(text "GPIO 38, 39, 40 stay free for the INMP441 microphone reserved in Pins.h (no room for its header on this board)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 252.73 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f0232d51-b55b-5503-a1c1-9bf79cfa7332"))
(text "AS5600: tie its DIR pin to GND at the module. C1 sits next to U2's VM pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ece2b959-2bb5-59a5-8715-c5855f3a9582"))
